WNOTE='const WNOTE={"ا":"From the top straight down.","ج":"Briefly to the right at the top, then diagonally down to the left and in a big curve to the right.","ح":"Briefly to the right at the top, then diagonally down to the left and in a big curve to the right.","خ":"Briefly to the right at the top, then diagonally down to the left and in a big curve to the right.","س":"Three teeth from right to left, then the big curve.","ش":"Three teeth from right to left, then the big curve.","ص":"First the loop clockwise, then the small tooth and the curve.","ض":"First the loop clockwise, then the small tooth and the curve.","ط":"First the belly, then the long stroke from top to bottom.","ظ":"First the belly, then the long stroke from top to bottom.","ع":"Start at the top right, curve the head round to the left, then down in a big curve.","غ":"Start at the top right, curve the head round to the left, then down in a big curve.","ف":"First the small head clockwise, then the line to the left.","ق":"First the small head clockwise, then the deep curve.","و":"First the small head clockwise, then the tail down to the left.","ك":"From top to bottom, then the line to the left. The small mark comes last.","ل":"From top to bottom, then the curve up to the left."};'
